xdcode --worktree mcp list: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `xdcode fork`, `xdcode exec`, and `xdcode exec fork`
xdcode fork --worktree: `xdcode fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
xdcode fork --worktree --last: `xdcode fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
xdcode exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `xdcode exec fork --worktree`
xdcode exec review --worktree: `--worktree` is not supported for code review
